{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>Fruit of a tree</b> Two times in the Masorah: אשר בו פרי עץ (in which is fruit of a tree). פרי עץ הדר (fruit of a majestic tree). Hint to the opinion that the tree from which Adam the first man ate was an etrog." "<b>זכר</b> in gematria: ברכה. נקיבה, like gematria: בקללה."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:28.860274901Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}